:null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:15:08Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-09-06T01:58:21Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T09:11:27Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123240","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123240","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123240.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123240.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis code is bogus:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\ncase Variant::PACKED_FLOAT64_ARRAY: {\r\n\tPackedFloat64Array packed_array;\r\n\tpacked_array.resize(numbers_to_read);\r\n\tfor (int64_t j = 0; j < numbers_to_read; j++) {\r\n\t\tpacked_array.set(value_index, numbers[number_index + j]);\r\n\t}\r\n} break;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt sets the wrong indices in `packed_array`, then doesn't use it, the `packed_array` just ends up discarded.\r\n\r\nThis broken code was introduced by me in PR #109103, my bad!\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis problem was caught and fixed by AI. I wrote the original code, I know the intention of this code, this fix is correct. Also, the mix of `[]` and `.set()` is intentional.\r\n\r\nThis isn't used anywhere internally, the fix only benefits user code if it needs accessors decoded as these types.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123240/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123240/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}